# Line endings (added 2026-10-04 [delegated]). Git on Windows, including
# GitHub's windows-latest runners, converts text to CRLF on checkout unless
# told otherwise. Golden fixtures are compared byte for byte, so they must
# never be converted, and the tree hash used to identify a tested revision
# must not depend on the machine that committed it.

# Everything: LF in the repository and in every working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Golden fixtures: byte-exact, never converted (overrides the line above).
fixtures/** -text
*.mochi binary
*.bin binary
